Every second, users’ data is being collected & stored by online applications and websites. The GDPR entitles EU citizens to various rights, however exercising these rights on one’s own is not easy.

That’s why we introduce you to SOMI. The first app that enables its members to exercise GDPR rights and take control over their personal data hassle-free and safe.

SOMI FOR INDIVIDUALS
·Get informed which organizations violate your privacy rights;

·See what personal data has been collected on you;

·Request your data to be fully or partially deleted from online platforms;

·File a lawsuit in case your privacy rights have been violated;

·Get financial compensation, when applicable.


SOMI FOR BUSINESSES
·Ensure always being GDPR compliant

·See your DPE rating

·Get advice on what to do when receiving a data request, complaint, or legal action from users.

